# Route: guide 30 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to
# 53, 11 quests, 1.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Burning Steppes, Badlands, Arathi Highlands): Ruins of Thaurissan ->
# Blackrock Stronghold -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Mountain -> Kargath
# -> Camp Cagg -> Kargath -> Camp Cagg -> Faldir's Cove.
